//- Our Approach
.our-apporach
    .container
        h2.title Our Approach 

        .row.approach-box.justify-content-between
            .h-col-4
                .approach-item
                    h4.title Discuss
                    p.content We listen to your ideas, requirements, and goals to understand the project scope.

            .h-col-4
                .approach-item
                    h4.title Research
                    p.content Deep dive into market trends, competitor analysis, and technical feasibility.

            .h-col-4
                .approach-item
                    h4.title Plan & Schedule
                    p.content Creating a roadmap, selecting the tech stack, and defining timelines for development.

            .h-col-4
                .approach-item
                    h4.title Development & Testing
                    p.content Agile coding of the solution with continuous internal testing to ensure quality.

            .h-col-4
                .approach-item
                    h4.title UAT & Revisions
                    p.content User Acceptance Testing by your team, followed by any necessary refinements.

            .h-col-4
                .approach-item
                    h4.title Hands Off
                    p.content Final deployment, training, and smooth handover of the project ownership.
